#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>テレビでも見れたらいいのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd much rather have an actual TV...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …そういう訳にもいかないか。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But I don't think that's gonna happen."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>プールに監視カメラって…
#. かなり、犯罪臭がするぞ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera at the pool... That seems even\n"
"more villainous than normal.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーか…
#. ここにあっても不自然ではないよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Lockers... Nothing strange about that.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>室内プールから出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the pool?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
